n godot\n2. Write a function declaration like \"func test():\" and press enter\n3. Backspace to remove the automatically created indentation so that your cursor is that you cursor is at the start of the line\n4. Press ctrl + shift + enter (or whatever your binding is set to for \"ui_text_newline_above\")\n5. Notice the new line has no indent, even though it should\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116969/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116969/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}